# DDL Deep Research: Toàn bộ Tiềm năng & Tác động Giá trị

## I. DDL Architecture — Full Map

### 4 Layers, 6,421 Data Points

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    DDL DATABASE (ddl.db)                 │
│                       2.6 MB SQLite                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                         │
│  LAYER 1: Token Resolution Engine                       │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
│  │ 9 Collections (4-tier: Tailwind→Theme→Mode→Custom)│  │
│  │ 124 Groups · 1,106 Tokens · 306 References       │  │
│  │ 5,096 Resolved Values (mode×platform combos)      │  │
│  │ 23 Shadow Composites · 350 Color Details          │  │
│  │ 7 Agent Context Rules                             │  │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘       │
│                                                         │
│  LAYER 2: Component Schema Engine                       │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
│  │ 18 Component Schemas (primitive/pattern/composition)│ │
│  │   with: tokens, overridable, state, layout,        │  │
│  │   accessibility, keyboard nav, platform_hints       │  │
│  │ 28 Architecture Rules                             │  │
│  │ 41 Domain Features · 14 Domain Workflows          │  │
│  │ 21 Domain Integrations                            │  │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘       │
│                                                         │
│  LAYER 3: UX Intelligence Engine                        │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
│  │ 129 UX Guidelines (3 sources: ux-guidelines,       │  │
│  │     web-interface, 5 Critical rules)               │  │
│  │ 60 UX Laws (9 with trigger_conditions              │  │
│  │     for automated matching)                         │  │
│  │ 100 UI Reasoning Rules (pattern→recommendation)    │  │
│  │ 44 Performance Patterns (7 Critical)               │  │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘       │
│                                                         │
│  LAYER 4: Design Intelligence Engine                    │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
│  │ 96 Product Types (Banking, Fintech, etc.)           │  │
│  │   → primary_style, landing_pattern, dashboard_style │  │
│  │ 96 Color Palettes (per product type)                │  │
│  │ 57 Font Pairings (per mood/product)                 │  │
│  │ 67 UI Styles (with CSS keywords, implementation    │  │
│  │    checklist, design system variables)               │  │
│  │ 25 Chart Types · 27 Landing Patterns               │  │
│  │ 100 Icon Catalog (16 categories)                    │  │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘       │
│                                                         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### API Surface: 30+ Commands

| Command | Layer | Returns | Use case |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| `--resolve <path>` | 1 | Value + full chain + source tier | Token verification |
| `--query-type <type>` | 1 | All tokens of type by mode/platform | Color/spacing audit |
| `--query-group <prefix>` | 1 | Group of tokens (base.*, spacing.*) | Component token extraction |
| `--shadow <name>` | 1 | CSS shadow composite (multi-layer) | Shadow validation |
| `--accessibility` | 1 | 350 colors with WCAG contrast ratios | Compliance check |
| `--export <format>` | 1 | CSS/RN/Swift/JSON complete export | Dev handoff |
| `--agent-context <name>` | 1 | Usage rules + constraints + examples | Agent behavior rules |
| `--component <id>` | 2 | Full schema: tokens, state, layout, a11y, keyboard | Component audit |
| `--component-tokens <id>` | 2 | Resolved token values for component | Pixel-perfect spec |
| `--search-components <q>` | 2 | Component search results | Component detection |
| `--guidelines [filters]` | 3 | UX rules by category/severity/source/law-ref | Check generation |
| `--ux-laws [filters]` | 3 | Laws by category/keyword + trigger_conditions | Auto-matching |
| `--ui-reasoning [filters]` | 3 | Pattern → recommendation rules | Design decisions |
| `--perf-pattern <issue>` | 3 | Performance anti-patterns | Performance audit |
| `--product-type <name>` | 4 | Style + palette + landing + considerations | Industry context |
| `--color-palette <product>` | 4 | Primary/secondary/text/bg/CTA/border colors | Palette validation |
| `--font-pairing <product>` | 4 | Heading + body font pair + mood | Typography check |
| `--ui-style <name>` | 4 | Full style spec: effects, a11y, CSS keywords | Style compliance |
| `--icon <name>` | 4 | Icon info by category/keyword | Icon audit |

