## II. Workflow Phase × DDL Capability Matrix

### Khoảng trống hiện tại

| Workflow Phase | DDL capabilities HIỆN dùng | DDL capabilities CÓ THỂ dùng | Gap |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| **Phase 1d** (Screenshots) | ❌ Không | — | — |
| **Phase 2a-bis** (Boundaries) | ❌ Không | `--icon` catalog → icon fingerprint validation | Icon name matching |
| **Phase 2a-pre** (Metadata) | ❌ Không | `--search-components` → auto-detect DDL components | Component pre-identification |
| **Phase 2d** (Flow inference) | ❌ Không | `--ux-laws` trigger_conditions → auto-flag laws per flow stage | Automated law matching |
| **Phase 2g** (OCR) | ❌ Không | `--resolve` → verify token values in OCR text | Token value verification |
| **Phase 3** (PRD gen) | ❌ Không | `--product-type` → industry context, `--component` → states | PRD enrichment |
| **Phase 4e** (Signal inference) | "DDL" mentioned | `--guidelines` + `--ux-laws` + `--component` | **Full DDL query** |
| **Skill A** (Signal + DDL) | "dựa vào DDL" | `--guidelines --severity High` + `--ux-laws` with triggers | **Structured queries** |
| **Skill B** (PRD cross-ref) | "cross-ref DDL" | `--component <matched>` + `--guidelines --category` | **Component spec match** |
| **Skill C** (Vision review) | "map DDL" | `--accessibility` + `--resolve` + `--component-tokens` | **WCAG + token audit** |
| **Bước 5** (Report) | ❌ Không | `--product-type` → industry benchmark context | Industry-aware scoring |

